Celsius is eight point four times ten to the minus seven.

6
00:00:24.095 --> 00:00:27.927
Use the Arrhenius equation, with the temperature in kelvin.

7
00:00:27.927 --> 00:00:31.376
Twelve hundred Celsius is fourteen seventy three kelvin.

8
00:00:31.996 --> 00:00:35.358
