9
00:00:35.358 --> 00:00:38.399
point three one four times fourteen seventy three.

10
00:00:38.399 --> 00:00:40.640
That is fourteen point seven eight.

11
00:00:41.260 --> 00:00:46.650
So D is about six point one times ten to the minus eleven square meters per second.

12
00:00:47.271 --> 00:00:49.817
That is nowhere near eight point four times ten to

13
00:00:49.817 --> 00:00:52.566
the minus seven, so the statement is false.

14
00:00:54.166 --> 00:00:56.062
So the answer is B: false.

15
00:00:56.881 --> 00:01:01.198
